  "title_en": "Akbank ODTÜ & Boğaziçi Üniversitesi X Photobooth Activity",
  "description_en": "As MetasoftCo, we provided an interactive photobooth experience for the events held at Ankara METU and Istanbul Boğaziçi University campuses within the scope of Akbank Youth Academy. With our AI-powered photography activities, we transformed students' campus memories into digital and physical outputs, ensuring high brand engagement.",
  "content_en": "<h2>Akbank&nbsp;Campus&nbsp;Events:&nbsp;Digital&nbsp;Photo&nbsp;Activity&nbsp;Solutions</h2><p>To&nbsp;adapt&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;dynamic&nbsp;structure&nbsp;of&nbsp;Akbank&#39;s&nbsp;university&nbsp;campuses,&nbsp;interactive&nbsp;<strong>photobooth</strong>&nbsp;stations&nbsp;were&nbsp;established&nbsp;with&nbsp;the&nbsp;expertise&nbsp;of&nbsp;MetasoftCo.&nbsp;Our&nbsp;project,&nbsp;which&nbsp;met&nbsp;with&nbsp;thousands&nbsp;of&nbsp;students&nbsp;in&nbsp;both&nbsp;Ankara&nbsp;and&nbsp;Istanbul,&nbsp;showcased&nbsp;the&nbsp;power&nbsp;of&nbsp;digitalization&nbsp;in&nbsp;event&nbsp;marketing.</p><p></p><h3>What&nbsp;Was&nbsp;Offered&nbsp;Within&nbsp;the&nbsp;Scope&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;Project?</h3><ul><li><strong>Instant&nbsp;Sharing:</strong>&nbsp;QR&nbsp;code&nbsp;technology&nbsp;enabled&nbsp;photos&nbsp;to&nbsp;be&nbsp;shared&nbsp;on&nbsp;social&nbsp;media&nbsp;within&nbsp;seconds.</li><li><strong>Custom&nbsp;Designed&nbsp;Frames:</strong>&nbsp;Digital&nbsp;interfaces&nbsp;and&nbsp;physical&nbsp;print&nbsp;templates&nbsp;specially&nbsp;prepared&nbsp;for&nbsp;Akbank&#39;s&nbsp;corporate&nbsp;identity&nbsp;were&nbsp;utilized.</li><li><strong>High-Quality&nbsp;Lighting:</strong>&nbsp;Studio-quality&nbsp;results&nbsp;were&nbsp;achieved&nbsp;in&nbsp;all&nbsp;environments&nbsp;with&nbsp;ring&nbsp;lights&nbsp;and&nbsp;professional&nbsp;equipment.</li></ul><p></p><h3><a href=\"/en/services/photobooth-and-photo-activations/photobooth-rental\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Photobooth&nbsp;Rental&nbsp;in&nbsp;Ankara&nbsp;and&nbsp;Istanbul</a></h3><p>As&nbsp;MetasoftCo,&nbsp;we&nbsp;provide&nbsp;the&nbsp;latest&nbsp;technology&nbsp;<strong>event&nbsp;photo&nbsp;activities</strong>&nbsp;as&nbsp;a&nbsp;turnkey&nbsp;solution&nbsp;for&nbsp;corporate&nbsp;events&nbsp;in&nbsp;Ankara&nbsp;and&nbsp;Istanbul,&nbsp;just&nbsp;as&nbsp;we&nbsp;do&nbsp;at&nbsp;every&nbsp;point&nbsp;in&nbsp;Turkey.</p>",
